1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,080
 The alarm goes off at 4.45 and the house is still dark.

2
00:00:05,080 --> 00:00:08,880
 You could roll over and nobody would know.

3
00:00:08,880 --> 00:00:14,380
 You lace up anyway because over in Teaneck the lights are on and your crew is waiting

4
00:00:14,380 --> 00:00:16,160
 on you.

5
00:00:16,160 --> 00:00:20,540
 Cold air, heavy legs, round one.

6
00:00:20,540 --> 00:00:24,520
 By the time this town wakes up, you've already won Monday.

